> Dear Chulpan,
>
> Thank you very much for your thoughtful email and for taking the time to
> carefully review our company profile, catalog, and production materials.
>
> I truly appreciate the effort you are putting into getting to know our
> company before introducing us to your business partners. Your
> professional approach gives me great confidence, and I genuinely have a
> very positive feeling about the possibility of working together. I
> sincerely hope that our discussions will lead to a successful long-term
> cooperation.
>
> I also appreciate your interest in arranging a video meeting. Whenever
> you feel you have completed your review and are ready, I will be happy
> to schedule a meeting at a time that is convenient for you. I look
> forward to speaking with you personally.
>
> Please find my answers to your additional questions below:
>
> =E2=80=A2 Dyma LLC
>
> Our cooperation with Dyma LLC was a completed project. After its
> completion, there was no further follow-up from either side.
>
> =E2=80=A2 MOQ
>
> Our standard MOQ is 100 pieces per style. The MOQ per colour is flexible
> and can always be discussed depending on the customer's requirements and
> the order structure.
>
> =E2=80=A2 Custom designs and technical packs
>
> Absolutely. We are able to manufacture garments based entirely on our
> customers' requirements. Whether the customer provides their own
> designs, technical packs, size specifications, or other production
> details, our team has the capability to develop samples and manufacture
> the products accordingly.
>
> =E2=80=A2 Fabric sourcing
>
> We work with both locally sourced and imported fabrics. We are very
> flexible in this regard and can source materials according to our
> customers' preferences, quality requirements, and budget.
>
> =E2=80=A2 Quality standards and testing
>
> Our company is familiar with the quality standards commonly required in
> the Russian market. As part of our quality control process, we routinely
> perform fabric testing, including abrasion resistance, shrinkage, and
> fabric drape evaluations to ensure that our products meet the expected
> quality standards.
>
> =E2=80=A2 Production facilities
>
> Some parts of our production process and certain machinery are operated
> in cooperation with trusted partner factories. These partners work
> strictly according to our production standards, quality requirements,
> and technical specifications, ensuring consistent product quality
> throughout the manufacturing process.
>
> Once again, thank you very much for your continued interest in Raspina
> Clothing. It is a pleasure communicating with you, and I truly
> appreciate your professionalism and the time you have invested in
> learning about our company.
>
> I look forward to hearing from you again and to our future video
> meeting.
>
> Kind regards,
>
> Soheil Zali
> Raspina Clothing
>

